# MQ08 "Blood of the Daedra". Martin's greeting at MQ07 90 set MQ08 10: he needs a Daedric artifact. Asked about
# it he points at the book "Modern Heretics" (15). Any Daedric quest's last stage sets 20; the book names Azura's
# shrine, so the player does hers (DAAzura): glow dust offered at dawn or dusk, Azura speaks (20), the five vampires
# of the Gutted Mine die (30), the shrine gives Azura's Star (100 -> MQ08 20). Martin takes the Star (30 -> 100).
# DRAFT from tools/live/quest_brief.py (2026-11-13): not run yet.

# Martin: "Daedric artifact" at 10 (INFO 00026EFA) sets 15.
case mq08_martin_artifact
until 300 GetStage MQ08 >= 10
run
player.moveto MartinRef
wait 120
approach MartinRef
talk MartinRef
ask "Daedric artifact"
until 300 GetStage MQ08 >= 15
bye if open
end

# Azura's shrine (DaAzuraShrineRef 00098206, DAAzuraStatueScript): between 5 and 7 or 17 and 19 o'clock, with glow
# dust and level 2 or more, activating it asks "Do you wish to offer Glow Dust to the altar of Azura?"; "Yes"
# (button 0) takes the dust, Azura speaks four lines with the player's controls off, then sets DAAzura 20. The glow
# dust is the player's will-o-the-wisp hunt, the level their play so far: additem and setlevel stand in for both.
case mq08_azura_offering
run
player.setlevel 2
# MorrowindRuntime's level-up menu comes a moment later; `pick` waits for it (a `wait` here failed whenever the menu
# opened inside it: "a menu holds the game", 31d, 38h).
pick Strength
pick Endurance
pick Agility
pick OK
run
player.additem GlowDust 1
player.moveto 00098206
wait 120
run
set gamehour to 5.2
wait 60
activate 00098206
button 0
until 600 player.GetItemCount GlowDust == 0
until 3600 GetStage DAAzura >= 20
end

# The Gutted Mine: the five vampires (ACHR 00098207 .. 0009820B, DAAzuraVampScript OnDeath adds 1 to
# DAAzura.vampsdead); kill stands in for each fight. DAAzuraScript sets 30 at five dead.
case mq08_gutted_mine
run
player.moveto 00098207
wait 120
run
00098207.kill
00098208.kill
00098209.kill
0009820A.kill
0009820B.kill
until 300 DAAzura.vampsdead == 5
until 300 GetStage DAAzura >= 30
end

# Back at the shrine at 30: activating it makes Azura speak twice, then sets DAAzura 100 and gives Azura's Star;
# 100's result sets MQ08 20.
case mq08_azura_star
run
player.moveto 00098206
wait 120
activate 00098206
until 3600 GetStage DAAzura >= 100
expect player.GetItemCount AzurasStar >= 1
until 300 GetStage MQ08 >= 20
end

# Martin: "Daedric artifact" at 20 (INFO 00026D6D) offers the artifacts the player holds; "Give Azura's Star."
# (INFO 00026D6B) sets 30, whose result sets 100, and offers "What else can I do to help?" (INFO 00026EF4, MQ10
# == 0): Martin sends the player to Jauffre about Bruma (MQ10 10).
case mq08_give_star
run
player.moveto MartinRef
wait 120
approach MartinRef
talk MartinRef
ask "Daedric artifact"
ask "Give Azura's Star."
until 300 GetStage MQ08 >= 30
until 300 GetStageDone MQ08 100
expect player.GetItemCount AzurasStar == 0
ask "What else can I do to help?"
until 300 GetStage MQ10 >= 10
bye if open
end
